        "y0": 0.5294267819782901,
        "x1": 0.8323319635471376,
        "y1": 0.541258895765291
      },
      "text": "bras K for which we can guarantee that K[L] will be representable. Specifically we",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.20934450806689864,
        "y0": 0.5436785634509742,
        "x1": 0.5578458385307248,
        "y1": 0.555510677237975
      },
      "text": "ask whether K must be a finite Sugihara chain.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.20934452088941044,
