        "y0": 0.6018260754202438,
        "x1": 0.8323352845776982,
        "y1": 0.6136581892072446
      },
      "text": "In this section we recall the basic definitions of the algebras used in this paper. The",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
